                                "sense_id": "78a74e32-d3ea-3591-9b37-41e4fa64a698",
                                "text": "Whatever made fun for one party called the attention of the other, and no sooner would their eyes be off from their own course than they would bump against a rock, and the tables were turned; the laughers became the laughees."
                            }
